    "description": "Duplex in Inner Richmond district of San Francisco. Classic two-unit building with more recent renovations. Each unit offers 2 bedrooms and 2 baths. This beautifully maintained property offers an exceptional opportunity for both investors and homeowners seeking a versatile living space in one of the city's most vibrant neighborhoods.  Classic Edwardian architectural details, such as hardwood floors, high ceilings, and large windows, adding timeless charm. The two units includes a shared backyard and two car tandem garage for additional parking and extra storage. Located just steps from the vibrant Clement Street corridor, easy access to a variety of local shops, cafes, and restaurants. Close proximity to Golden Gate Park, Lands End, and Ocean Beach, providing ample opportunities for outdoor activities. Public transit options are also nearby, making commuting a breeze. This duplex offers a unique opportunity to own a piece of San Francisco in one of its most sought-after areas. Whether you're looking to live in one unit and rent out the other, or seeking a valuable investment, this is the one."
  },
